+## Checkout — `/api/v1/checkout` (User)
 
-| Method | Path | Access | Notes |
-|---|---|---|---|
-| POST | `/` | User | `{ customerName, customerPhone, shippingAddress, paymentMethod? }` (default `COD`). One transaction: validate stock → create the order (`PENDING_PAYMENT`) and items with price snapshot → deduct stock → write the first history row → create `PENDING` payment → empty cart |
+Body (both endpoints): `{ addressId | { customerName, customerPhone, shippingAddress }, discountCode?, paymentMethod }`, `paymentMethod` = `COD`, `VIETQR` or `MOMO`. A client can never send a price, total, discount amount, shipping fee, status or user id: they are not read.
+
+| Method | Path | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| POST | `/preview` | 200 `{ items[{productId,name,unitPrice,quantity,lineTotal,available}], subtotal, discountAmount, shippingFee, total, discountCode, issues[{productId,code,message}] }`. No side effect: no lock, no reservation, no write. Address and payment method are not needed |
+| POST | `/` | 201 `OrderResponse` (`PENDING_PAYMENT`). One transaction: lock the cart row → items with products → validate (ACTIVE, stock) → subtotal → discount → shipping → total → create the order with an address snapshot → reserve stock in ascending product id → `PENDING` payment → empty the cart last. Empty cart, inactive product, bad discount code or not enough stock → 400 `BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION` (stock message names the product); another user's `addressId` → 403 |
+
+Shipping: `ecogreen.shipping.flat-fee` (default 30 000 ₫, env `SHIPPING_FLAT_FEE`) is added unless `subtotal − discount` is at least `ecogreen.shipping.free-threshold` (default 500 000 ₫, env `FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD`; exactly the threshold is free).
+
+## Discounts — `/api/v1/admin/discounts` (`discount:view` to read, `discount:manage` to write; no admin UI yet)
+
+| Method | Path | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| GET | `/` | paged (`page`, `size`, `sort` ∈ `id`,`code`,`createdAt`,`validTo`; filters `keyword`, `active`) |
+| GET | `/{id}` | |
+| POST | `/` | 201; `{ code, percentOff \| amountOff (exactly one), minOrderAmount?, validFrom?, validTo?, active? }`; the code is stored upper-case; a duplicate (any case) is 409 |
+| PUT | `/{id}` | same body |
+| DELETE | `/{id}` | 204 (orders keep their own copy of the code) |
+
+## Orders
+
+Placing an order is `POST /api/v1/checkout` (above); the legacy `POST /api/orders` was removed in B04.
 
